horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Amber%20Staff\"><img alt=\"Amber Staff\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Amber_Staff_6d8b61.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rope Belt\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rope_Belt_855efc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\"><img alt=\"Yellow Gem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yellow_Gem_df5dcd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Forbidden Temple Entrance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"91\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Forbidden_Temple_Entrance_b4759a.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>This temple is buried under the sands of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a>. It is inhabited by Low Class Lizards and Cult members, who worship a lizard god there. This hunting place was introduced in update 10.8 together with a lot of other new hunting places.\n</p><p>The entrance is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33315,32675,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33315, 32675, 7)</a>, hidden by the tree. You may need to dig a few times before it opens. On the final floor, Incompetent Idiots (Book) can be found <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33344,32688,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33344, 32688, 10)</a>.\n</p><p>The third level underground has many <a href=\"#/wiki/Voodoo%20Cultists\">Voodoo Cultists</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizards\">Low Class Lizards</a>, being easy to get swarmed. On the fourth floor, there are 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Enlightened%20of%20the%20Cult\">Enlightened of the Cult</a>, 11 <a href=\"#/wiki/Adept%20of%20the%20Cult\">Adepts of the Cult</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Snakecharmer\">Lizard Snakecharmer</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\">Cobras</a>, and sometimes the boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Tzumrah%20the%20Dazzler\">Tzumrah the Dazzler</a>. Overall, the third and fourth floor of this dungeon are entirely full of ranged monsters, making those floors more wasteful for <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>. This hunting spot is good for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, and using a Shield and <a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Star\">Royal Stars</a> or Enchanted Spears, and Recovery.\n</p><p>On most occasions, the majority of profit will come from Rope Belts, which are used for <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">imbuing</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_floor\">First floor</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\"><img alt=\"Cobra\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cobra_cbac54.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\">Cobra</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">65</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra%20Tongue\">Cobra Tongue</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\"><img alt=\"Novice of the Cult\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Novice_of_the_Cult_05436f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\">Novice of the Cult</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">285</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">270</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-40× <a href=